{
  "description": "Every envelope a peer must accept or refuse, as raw text: what the frame is, whether it is valid, and which side it is addressed to — a server (it carries a client's ids, c:N, and answers a server's, s:N), a client, or either. A refused frame ends the connection; the harness sends each row over a raw connection to a peer of the named role and holds that the peer ended, or did not.",
